  <item>
    <title>Vol.71 假如给你三天假期，你会选择怎么度过？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ae744e797726cd4675b0e5f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ae744e797726cd4675b0e5f</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>此刻🎧里是陈绮贞唱《旅行的意义》~本期文E时间，狐狸品尝了夜的贵阳，达西拥抱了热情的岛屿，特来跟大家分享这两趟旅行！每次旅行前都会做好一堆计划，想在最快的时间体验最多，但回头想想，旅行的意义或许也不必非得清楚明白，当我们置身不同的地方，当地美食对味蕾的冲击，吹拂过来的晚风是新鲜的味道，在某一刻我们都会突然明白旅行的意义。工作间隙大家不妨也来想想！😁如果给你三天假期，你会选择去哪里度过呢？</span></p><p><span>👂🏻接下来，请你欢乐地听吧~</span><br></p><p><strong><span>-时间轴-</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="26">00:26</a>｜🦊去贵阳吃遍美食，🐧去普吉岛晒到脱皮</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="771">12:51</a>｜贵州腊肉香到失语！贵阳人到底有多会吃？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1467">24:27</a>｜出国语言不通怎么办？AI居然能救场！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2868">47:48</a>｜黄果树瀑布怎么去？贵阳➡️黄果树实用攻略</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3565">59:25</a>｜贵阳豆米火锅：连豆子和蘸水都让人上头！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4342">72:22</a>｜不赶景点，来一场贵阳 City Walk</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5018">83:38</a>｜比起千篇一律的打卡点，更让人记住的是街头的烟火气</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6063">101:03</a>｜不会游泳想浮潜怎么办？海岛度假指南</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>-主播-</span></strong></p><p><span>社交悍匪狐狸🦊</span></p><p><span>不正经的达西🐧</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>-正经推荐-</span></strong></p><p><span>🍽️</span></p><p><span>贵阳土豆片</span></p><p><span>锅巴糍粑</span></p><p><span>贵州豆米火锅</span></p><p><span>豆腐鱼</span></p><p><span>贵阳米皮</span></p><p><span>贵阳烤鱼</span></p><p><span>☕️⭐️</span></p><p><span>胡豆咖啡、黑石咖啡、乔治队长</span></p><p><span>⛱️</span></p><p><span>打抛饭</span></p><p><span>芒果糯米饭</span></p><p><span>椰子</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhK7mkc4eNxd_3C2ZUyrvrdlLHdx.png"><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/661684354408d7d4c1f15af1/lkl2E84DURpPfg4RLvGn4medeekL.m4a" length="113541666" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:57:00</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr9xpMdlwNJLfv15U2TpMmgru_yM.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
